    "Action: Load scenario via getTestScenario and inject via injectGameState.",
    "Expect: Start in MAIN_PHASE with Player 1 turn; Player 2 shield[0] is GD01-091 and Player 2 slot2 has GD01-030 (<Breach 2>) with damageReceived=2 and no pilot.",
    "Action: Player 1 attacks Player 2 shield area with slot1 GD01-020_attacker_0001 and resolve confirmBattle for both players.",
    "Expect: BURST_EFFECT_CHOICE appears for Player 2 on GD01-091.",
    "Action: Player 2 confirms burst choice with confirmed=true.",
    "Expect: GD01-091 moves from Player 2 shield area to Player 2 hand.",
    "Action: End Player 1 turn. On Player 2 MAIN_PHASE, play GD01-091 from hand as pilot onto Player 2 slot2 GD01-030_breach_host_0001.",
    "Expect: Player 2 slot2 becomes paired and still has <Breach>; damageReceived remains 2 before battle.",
    "Action: On the same Player 2 turn, attack Player 1 rested slot2 GD01-001_enemy_low_ap_target_0001 (AP3) with Player 2 slot2 and resolve confirmBattle.",
    "Expect: Because it is Player 2's turn and the enemy Unit has 3 AP, GD01-091 prevention applies; Player 2 slot2 receives no additional battle damage (damageReceived stays 2) and survives while the Player 1 target is destroyed.",
    "Action: End Player 2 turn. On Player 1 turn, attack Player 2 rested slot2 with Player 1 slot3 GD01-020_followup_attacker_0002 and resolve confirmBattle.",
    "Expect: It is no longer Player 2's turn, so the prevention is inactive; Player 2 slot2 receives battle damage from AP2 and is destroyed."
  ],
